amentals"},{"text":"Export requirements"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Statistical process control"},{"text":"ERP/QMS fundamentals"},{"text":"Data analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Auditing"},{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Problem solving"},{"text":"Attention to detail"},{"text":"Cross-functional coordination"}]}]},{"heading":"Final Portfolio Target","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, a strong candidate should have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Food science fundamentals"},{"text":"Food microbiology knowledge"},{"text":"HACCP plan"},{"text":"GMP/GHP knowledge"},{"text":"Food-safety risk assessment"},{"text":"Internal audit project"},{"text":"CAPA/root-cause project"},{"text":"Food-quality dashboard"},{"text":"Traceability/recall exercise"},{"text":"Food-industry internship"},{"text":"Regulatory-awareness project"},{"text":"Quality-system documentation"},{"text":"Final food-safety/QA capstone"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Graduate Profile"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Tech/B.E. Food Technology → Food Science → Food Microbiology → Food Processing → Food Safety → HACCP → GMP/GHP → Quality Systems → Auditing → CAPA → Food Regulations → Quality Analytics → Industry Internship → Quality Assurance Executive → Senior QA Executive → QA Specialist/Manager → Head of Quality/Food Safety"},{"type":"flow","items":["The strongest modern profile combines Food Technology","HACCP","Food Safety","Quality Management Systems","Auditing","Regulatory Compliance","Data Analytics","Manufacturing Experience."],"sep":"+"}]}]}